Name\":\"text-obsidian/70\",\"children\":\"Captionit\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-obsidian/75\",\"children\":[\"Captionit\",\" is a caption and video studio that runs in your browser: it transcribes your videos on your own device, styles the words with animated caption templates, and gives you a full multi-track editor and a set of creator tools around it — no uploads to a rendering farm, no software to install.\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10 space-y-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"what\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#what\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"What you can do here\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [\u0026_a]:font-medium [\u0026_a]:underline [\u0026_a]:decoration-orange-accent [\u0026_a]:decoration-2 [\u0026_a]:underline-offset-4 [\u0026_li]:ml-5 [\u0026_li]:list-disc [\u0026_li]:pl-1 [\u0026_strong]:text-obsidian [\u0026_ul]:space-y-1.5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Captions:\"}],\" speech recognition runs in your browser (English, Roman Hinglish and Devanagari Hindi), timed word by word, with 150 animated templates and a word-level editor.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Editing:\"}],\" a multi-track timeline with trims, splits, text and media overlays, effects, transitions, speed changes and an audio studio — and what you preview is what the export renders.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Clipper:\"}],\" find the moments worth posting from a longer video — suggestions measured on the device from silence and scene changes, plus an AI Clipping Studio that ranks moments from the transcript with an editorial estimate — then reframe them for vertical formats.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Creator Studio:\"}],\" hook ideas, scripts, captions and hashtags, a reel analyzer, a content planner, a teleprompter and growth tracking — the AI writing tools run on a free model and say so when they fall back to templates.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Exports:\"}],\" MP4 video plus SRT, VTT, ASS, plain-text and JSON caption files, and transparent overlays for other editors (rendered by the free desktop Companion app).\"]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"how\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#how\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"How it works\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [\u0026_a]:font-medium [\u0026_a]:underline [\u0026_a]:decoration-orange-accent [\u0026_a]:decoration-2 [\u0026_a]:underline-offset-4 [\u0026_li]:ml-5 [\u0026_li]:list-disc [\u0026_li]:pl-1 [\u0026_strong]:text-obsidian [\u0026_ul]:space-y-1.5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The heavy work — transcription, editing previews and MP4 rendering — happens on your device, in the browser. Your video files live in your browser’s storage on this device; an account only syncs your projects, captions, full transcripts and settings — plus the file name, size, length and format of each video — so you can pick them up elsewhere. That design is also the privacy story: your audio is never sent to a third-party speech service. The\",\" \",\"$L14\",\" describes exactly what is stored where.\"]}]}]]}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\"]}],\"$L17\"]}],null,\"$L18\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"19:[]\nc:\"$W19\"\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"children\":\"$L1b\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1d\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L1e\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2ifkwjg7b6d0t.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/278_yv101xrfo.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1f:I[237666,[\"/_next/static/chunks/11achr2dze1yq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0vjf7-qx5qdy3.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n14:[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/privacy\",\"children\":\"Privacy Policy\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"who\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#who\",\"className\":\"hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4\",\"children\":\"Who runs it\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [\u0026_a]:font-medium [\u0026_a]:underline [\u0026_a]:decoration-orange-accent [\u0026_a]:decoration-2 [\u0026_a]:underline-offset-4 [\u0026_li]:ml-5 [\u0026_li]:list-disc [\u0026_li]:pl-1 [\u0026_strong]:text-obsidian [\u0026_ul]:space-y-1.5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Captionit\",\" is built and run by \",\"Parvez Achhan Ali Siddiqui, an individual (sole proprietor) trading as Captionit\",\", based in \",\"India\",\". It is a one-person operation: the same person designs the templates, writes t